---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '../../styles/custom-shot-glasses.css';
import BrandAssets from '../../components/BrandAssets.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const title = 'Custom Shot Glasses for Bars & Events | YQ';
const description = 'Explore custom shot glasses in four popular styles with material and logo options for bars, events and branded gifts. Request a tailored quote.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f1eb" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="keywords" content="custom shot glasses" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://yqglasses.com/custom-shot-glasses/" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://yqglasses.com/custom-shot-glasses/" />
    <BrandAssets shareImage="https://yqglasses.com/images/custom-shot-glasses/hero.webp" shareImageType="image/webp" shareImageWidth={600} shareImageHeight={600} shareImageAlt="Custom shot glass styles" />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <SiteHeader />
    <div id="shot-glass-page">
      <main id="main">
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Custom & Ready-to-Ship Shot Glasses</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Choose in-stock shot glasses for quick dispatch, or create custom drinkware with your logo, artwork and preferred materials. Share your quantity and target date to confirm availability and lead time.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#quote">Request a Quote</a><a class="button secondary" href="#styles">Explore Styles</a></div>
        <div class="trustline"><span>In-stock options for fast dispatch</span><span>Custom logo and artwork</span><span>Multiple styles and materials</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="image-slot hero-image"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/hero.webp" alt="Custom shot glass styles" width="600" height="600" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
    </section>

    <div class="strip" aria-label="Product highlights">
      <div><b>Material Options</b><span>Multiple materials available</span></div><div><b>Sampling</b><span>Samples available</span></div><div><b>Logo Customization</b><span>Custom logos supported</span></div><div><b>Fast Dispatch</b><span>In-stock items: as fast as 1–3 days</span></div>
    </div>

    <section class="section" id="styles">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Four Popular Shot Glass Styles</h2></div><p>Capacities below are common listed examples, not fixed standards. Available sizes vary by supplier and model; confirm the selected product’s stated capacity before ordering.</p></div>
      <div class="types">
        <article class="type"><div class="image-slot"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/classic-straight-sided.webp" alt="Straight shot glass" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="type-copy"><h3>Classic Straight-Sided</h3><p>A versatile, clean profile for bars, parties, event favors and branded merchandise. The even sides provide a clear area for a simple logo or design.</p><div class="type-capacity"><span>Common listed capacity</span><strong>1–2 oz · 30–60 ml</strong><span class="type-mini-capacity">Mini sample formats from 5 ml may be available on request; confirm feasibility for the selected model.</span></div></div></article>
        <article class="type"><div class="image-slot"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/heavy-base.webp" alt="Heavy-base shot glass" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="type-copy"><h3>Heavy Base</h3><p>A thicker base gives the glass a more substantial feel and a classic barware look. Glass remains breakable and should be packed and handled with care.</p><div class="type-capacity"><span>Common listed capacity</span><strong>1.5–2 oz · 45–60 ml</strong><span class="type-mini-capacity">Mini sample formats from 5 ml may be available on request; confirm feasibility for the selected model.</span></div></div></article>
        <article class="type"><div class="image-slot"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/tall-shooter.webp" alt="Tall shot glass" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="type-copy"><h3>Tall Shooter</h3><p>A taller, slimmer profile for party service and distinctive drink presentation.</p><div class="type-capacity"><span>Common listed capacity</span><strong>1.5–2.5 oz · 45–75 ml</strong></div></div></article>
        <article class="type"><div class="image-slot"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/double-capacity.webp" alt="Double-capacity shot glass" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="type-copy"><h3>Double Capacity</h3><p>A larger format for projects that call for more volume. “Double” is not a universal capacity standard.</p><div class="type-capacity"><span>Common listed capacity</span><strong>2–3 oz · 60–90 ml</strong></div></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section white" id="materials">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="split-copy"><h2>Materials for Different Uses</h2><p>Material affects clarity, weight, breakage risk and decoration compatibility. Options depend on the selected style; not every material is available with every shape or finish.</p></div>
        <div>
          <div class="materials">
            <article class="material"><figure class="material-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/material-soda-lime.webp" alt="Soda-lime glass" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><h3>Soda-Lime Glass</h3><p>A widely used clear glass option for everyday barware, events and bulk orders. Performance depends on the product design and manufacturing process.</p></div></article>
            <article class="material"><figure class="material-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/material-lead-free-crystal.webp" alt="Lead-free crystal" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><h3>Lead-Free Crystal</h3><p>Offers a bright, refined appearance for premium gifts or branded collections. Confirm the material specification with the supplier.</p></div></article>
            <article class="material"><figure class="material-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/material-stainless-steel.webp" alt="Stainless steel" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><h3>Stainless Steel</h3><p>A non-transparent, break-resistant option for outdoor events and travel. Logo decoration is typically selected for the metal surface.</p></div></article>
            <article class="material"><figure class="material-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/material-plastic.webp" alt="Plastic shot glass" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div><h3>Plastic</h3><p>Lightweight and less prone to breakage, making it suitable for some large events. Confirm the exact plastic type and product-use guidance.</p></div></article>
          </div>
          <div class="note">Material availability depends on the selected style and decoration method.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="decoration">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Logo Decoration Methods</h2></div><p>The right method depends on the material, artwork detail, color count, order quantity and care requirements. Confirm compatibility for your selected product.</p></div>
      <div class="methods">
        <article class="method"><figure class="method-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/logo-screen-print.webp" alt="Screen-printed logo" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="num">01 / PRINT</div><h3>Screen Printing</h3><p>Crisp solid-color logos and simple graphics, especially for repeat production.</p><p class="method-materials"><strong>Materials:</strong> Glass; selected metals and plastics with compatible inks and surface treatment.</p><p class="method-colors"><strong>Color options:</strong> Solid and spot colors; exact matching depends on the ink and substrate.</p></article>
        <article class="method"><figure class="method-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/logo-ceramic-decal.webp" alt="Ceramic decal logo" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="num">02 / TRANSFER</div><h3>Ceramic Decal</h3><p>Detailed, multicolor artwork transferred to glass and fired for a durable finish.</p><p class="method-materials"><strong>Materials:</strong> Compatible glass or glazed ceramics; firing suitability must be confirmed for the item.</p><p class="method-colors"><strong>Color options:</strong> Multiple fired colors; final shades depend on the decal system and firing.</p></article>
        <article class="method"><figure class="method-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/logo-laser-engraving.webp" alt="Laser-engraved logo" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="num">03 / MARK</div><h3>Laser Engraving</h3><p>Permanent, ink-free monochrome marks with a subtle etched or frosted look.</p><p class="method-materials"><strong>Materials:</strong> Glass, crystal and stainless steel; selected plastics depend on the resin and laser system.</p><p class="method-colors"><strong>Color options:</strong> No ink colors. Glass usually appears frosted; metal and plastic marks vary by material and laser.</p></article>
        <article class="method"><figure class="method-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/logo-sandblasting.webp" alt="Sandblasted logo" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="num">04 / MATTE</div><h3>Sandblasting</h3><p>Permanent matte, tactile logos with strong shapes; very fine details may lose clarity.</p><p class="method-materials"><strong>Materials:</strong> Primarily glass and crystal for drinkware; metal compatibility depends on the finish and equipment.</p><p class="method-colors"><strong>Color options:</strong> No ink colors; creates a frosted matte contrast on clear glass.</p></article>
        <article class="method"><figure class="method-photo"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/logo-uv-digital-print.webp" alt="UV-printed logo" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" /></figure><div class="num">05 / DIGITAL</div><h3>UV or Digital Print</h3><p>Multicolor artwork, gradients and fine details printed directly on compatible surfaces.</p><p class="method-materials"><strong>Materials:</strong> Glass, stainless steel and selected plastics; primer and adhesion testing may be needed.</p><p class="method-colors"><strong>Color options:</strong> Full color and gradients; white ink for clear or dark surfaces depends on printer capability.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="note">Vector artwork is preferred. Samples are available on request; confirm material compatibility, finish and cleaning guidance for your selected decoration method.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="section white">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Custom Glasses for Your Project</h2></div></div>
        <div class="uses">
          <article class="use"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/use-bars.webp" alt="Cocktail bar interior" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" /><div class="use-copy"><h3>Bars & Distilleries</h3><p>Branded glasses for bar service, tasting events and merchandise collections.</p></div></article>
          <article class="use"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/use-wedding.webp" alt="Wedding reception table" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" /><div class="use-copy"><h3>Weddings & Parties</h3><p>Personalized names, dates or event artwork for favors and keepsakes.</p></div></article>
          <article class="use"><img src="/images/custom-shot-glasses/use-promotional-event.webp" alt="Corporate event venue" width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" /><div class="use-copy"><h3>Promotional Events</h3><p>Custom drinkware for trade shows, company celebrations and brand activations.</p></div></article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Specifications & Ordering</h2></div><p>Use the confirmed product details below to compare styles and request an accurate quote.</p></div>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table><tbody>
        <tr><th>Material</th><td>Glass, stainless steel or plastic options may be available by style.</td></tr><tr><th>Styles</th><td>Straight-sided, heavy-base, tall and larger-capacity profiles.</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity & dimensions</th><td>Confirm the exact volume and measurements for the selected model.</td></tr><tr><th>Decoration</th><td>Method depends on the material, artwork and selected product.</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum order</th><td>Confirmed for the style, decoration and packaging in your quote.</td></tr><tr><th>Packaging</th><td>Discuss protective and custom packaging options for your order.</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <div class="note">Pricing depends on style, material, quantity, decoration, color count, packaging and delivery destination. As glass is fragile, packaging and shipping arrangements are confirmed with the quote.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="section white" id="process">
      <div class="section-head"><div><h2>How to Order</h2></div></div>
      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M9 5.5h9l5 5V26H9z"/><path d="M18 5.5v5h5M12.5 16h7M12.5 20h7M12.5 12.5h2"/></svg></span><b>01</b></div><h3>Share Your Brief</h3><p>Send the style, material, quantity, artwork, packaging needs and target date.</p></article>
        <article class="step"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="8.5"/><path d="m20.5 20.5 6 6M10.5 14l2.5 2.5 5-5"/></svg></span><b>02</b></div><h3>Confirm the Method</h3><p>We check material and artwork compatibility, then confirm the quote and schedule.</p></article>
        <article class="step"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M8 5.5h12l4 4V26H8z"/><path d="M20 5.5v4h4M12 15h8M12 19l2.5 2.5L20 16"/></svg></span><b>03</b></div><h3>Approve the Design</h3><p>Review an artwork proof or sample when included in the project.</p></article>
        <article class="step"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M5 26V14l7 4v-5l7 4v-5l8 4v10z"/><path d="M10 22h2M16 22h2M22 22h2M8 10h4M10 8v4"/></svg></span><b>04</b></div><h3>Production</h3><p>Production begins after the order details and artwork are confirmed.</p></article>
        <article class="step"><div class="step-top"><span class="step-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="m5.5 11 10.5-5.5L26.5 11 16 16.5zM5.5 11v11L16 27.5 26.5 22V11M16 16.5v11"/><path d="m10.5 8.5 10.5 5.5"/></svg></span><b>05</b></div><h3>Pack & Ship</h3><p>Finished items are checked, packed and shipped according to the order terms.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section quote" id="quote">
      <div class="quote-copy"><h2>Let’s plan your<br /><em>shot glasses.</em></h2><p>Share your preferred style, estimated quantity and any design references. We’ll help you define the next step.</p><a class="button" href="/file-upload/?product=Shot%20Glasses&amp;order_type=custom">Send your requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="reference-note">Photos, sketches and artwork welcome.</span></div>
      <div class="quote-faq"><h3>Common questions</h3>
        <details><summary>Can I add a logo or personalized text?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Send us your artwork or wording. We’ll review suitable decoration methods and placement for the selected glass.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What is the minimum order quantity?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>MOQ depends on the glass style, material, decoration and packaging. Share your estimated quantity for a project-specific quote.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Which artwork file formats do you accept?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Vector artwork is preferred when available. Include your file with the inquiry so we can confirm compatibility.</p></details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
    <SiteFooter />
  </body>
</html>
